{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "flight",
  "title": "Flight: fill system and vehicle on the pad",
  "description": "The station in flight mode (normal, HITL, testing). The fill plumbing from the bottles through the actuator-board solenoids and the quick disconnect into the run tank, the valve-board vent, dump and main valves, and the motor standing on the KG50 load cell (fill mass). Below, the vehicle's AV bay: flight computer, power and RF boards on the AV CAN-FD bus, sensors, estimator, pyro channels and the radio to the ground station and the RRLS. Flow is drawn only when every valve on a path is confirmed open and the upstream pressure exceeds the downstream pressure.",
  "view_box": [0, 0, 1360, 1290],
  "stale_ms": 5000,
  "sources": [
    "FirmwareSimulator src/bay/native_plant.rs (Supply::paths: supply reaches the tank only with the AB valve open, the QD connected and the bottle open)",
    "GroundStation26 docs/firmware-sim.md (bottles, regulator 1000 psi, 15.85 L tank, vent vapour, dump liquid)",
    "GroundStation26 backend/src/telemetry_task.rs valve_state_values (VALVE_STATE order)",
    "GroundStation26 backend/src/gse/overpressure.rs (850 psi relief, 950 psi abort, defaults)",
    "ActuatorBoard26 main.h N2_SIG PB13, N20_SIG PB14, IGNITER_SIG PB12; ValveBoard26 main.h Solenoid PB11, servo_driver.h vent/dump servos",
    "GroundStation26 docs/data-pipeline.md (stream rates and meanings)",
    "GroundStation26 docs/data-pipeline.md sections 2.6 and 2.7 (FC 5 Hz, RF and PB 1 Hz)",
    "GroundStation26 backend/src/igt.rs (dry-run flags, FC SD word 6), backend/src/fc_estimator.rs, backend/src/recovery_events.rs",
    "FlightComputer26 main.h CO2 PB5 (drogue), REEF PB6 (main)",
    "RFBoard26 Core/Src/telemetry.c (router sides can and radio)",
    "GroundStation26 docs/live-diagrams.md (one view per station mode: the regular fill system has only the KG50 under the motor)"
  ],
  "fluids": [
